,3754,3755,3756,3757,3758,3759,3760]},"chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-053-chengbing","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-053","work_id":"w-sanguozhi","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-053-chengbing"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-053-xuezong:line039","text":"　　薛綜字敬文，沛郡竹邑人也。少依族人避地交州，從劉熙學。士燮既附孫權，召綜為五官中郎（將），除合浦、交阯太守。","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-053-xuezong:line039:m0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"薛綜","kind":"person","person_id":"yt7_qwp_k7p","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-053-xuezong:line039:m0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"敬文","kind":"person","person_id":"yt7_qwp_k7p","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-053-xuezong:line039:m0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"劉熙","kind":"person","person_id":"4j2_9t6_18d","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-053-xuezong:line039:m0029","start":29,"end":31,"surface":"士燮","kind":"person","person_id":"p2p_gqb_6ar","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-053-xuezong:line039:m0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"孫權","kind":"person","person_id":"572_278_cba","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-053-xuezong:line039:m0037","start":37,"end":38,"surface":"綜","kind":"person","person_id":"yt7_qwp_k7p","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"}],"annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":39,"last_line":39,"revision_id":2086397,"raw_start":4717,"raw_end":4890,"character_positions":[4717,4718,4719,4720,4721,4722,4723,4724,4725,4726,4727,4728,4729,4730,4731,4849,4850,4851,4852,4853,4854,4855,4856,4857,4858,4859,4860,4861,4862,4863,4864,4865,4866,4867,4868,4869,4870,4871,4872,4873,4874,4875,4876,4877,4878,4879,4880,4881,4882,4883,4884,4885,4886,4887,4888,4889]},"chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-053-xuezong","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-053","work_id":"w-sanguozhi","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-053-xuezong"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-053-xuezong:line045","text":"交阯糜泠、九真都龐二縣，皆兄死弟妻其嫂，世以此為俗，長吏恣聽，不能禁制。日郡男女夥體，不以為羞。由此言之，可謂蟲豸，有靦面目耳。然而土廣人眾，阻險毒害，易以為亂，難使從治。縣官羈縻，示令威服，田戶之租賦，裁取供辦，貴致遠珍名珠、香藥、象牙、犀角、玳瑁、珊瑚、琉璃、鸚鵡、翡翠、孔雀、奇物，充備寶玩，不必仰其賦入，以益中國也。然在九甸之外，長吏之選，類不精核。漢時法寬，多自放恣，故數反違法。珠崖之廢，起於長吏睹其好發，髡取為髲。及臣所見，南海黃蓋為日南太守，下車以供設不豐，撾殺主薄，仍見驅逐。九真太守儋萌為妻父周京作主人，並請大吏，酒酣作樂。功曹番歆起舞屬京，京不肯起，歆猶迫強，萌忿杖歆，亡於郡內。歆弟苗帥眾攻府，毒矢射萌，萌至物故。交阯太守士燮遣兵致討，卒不能克。又故刺史會稽朱符，多以鄉人虞褒、劉彥之徒分作長吏，侵虐百姓，強賦於民黃魚一枚收稻一斛，百姓怨叛，山賊並出，攻州突郡。符走入海，流離喪亡。次得南陽張津，與荊州牧劉表為隙，兵弱敵強，歲歲興軍，諸將厭患，去留自在。","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-053-xuezong:line045:m0221","start":221,"end":223,"surface":"黃蓋","kind":"person","person_id":"no2_m87_78v","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-053-xuezong:line045:m0251","start":251,"end":253,"surface":"儋萌","kind":"person","person_id":"dbc_qjy_48j","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-053-xuezong:line045:m0256","start":256,"end":258,"surface":"周京","kind":"person","person_id":"b44_x3s_5oz","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-053-xuezong:line045:m0274","start":274,"end":276,"surface":"番歆","kind":"person","person_id":"4p1_22p_iib","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-053-xuezong:line045:m0279","start":279,"end":280,"surface":"京","kind":"person","person_id":"b44_x3s_5oz","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-053-xuezong:line045:m0281","start":281,"end":282,"surface":"京","kind":"person","person_id":"b44_x3s_5oz","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-053-xuezong:line045:m0286","start":286,"end":287,"surface":"歆","kind":"person","person_id":"4p1_22p_iib","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-053-xuezong:li